      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Imposter syndrome is a common hurdle that often feels insurmountable, but remember that legacy is not a static object but a living story that evolves with each new chapter you add. You have the unique power to repair their work by sharing their vision, not by erasing your own humanity to fit a broken mold. Please seek professional support, as giving you tools to reframe this narrative could help you build a life where your family is proud, not ashamed, of who you truly are.",
